1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,036
I first met Hye-won at
an online master class.

2
00:00:03,036 --> 00:00:04,404
I do love flowers

3
00:00:04,404 --> 00:00:06,873
but I don't know what kind of
work I want to do.

4
00:00:06,873 --> 00:00:08,408
Until I set my goal

5
00:00:08,408 --> 00:00:09,976
I won't be dating anyone!

6
00:00:11,444 --> 00:00:13,480
Great mindset.

7
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,981
That goal of yours

8
00:00:14,981 --> 00:00:16,541
can be pursued while working
at my shop.

9
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:20,253
Just like that, I found
Hye-won, my first employee.

10
00:00:20,787 --> 00:00:23,790
For a while, It was enough
with just the two of us...

11
00:00:25,125 --> 00:00:26,559
Should we hire
a part time worker?

12
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,595
Nice to meet you.

13
00:00:28,595 --> 00:00:31,064
And so Eun-ho joined us,
two months ago.

14
00:00:32,465 --> 00:00:34,100
Are you sure about him?

15
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,136
I'm not really sure.

16
00:00:36,136 --> 00:00:38,304
But he does get the job done.

17
00:00:38,304 --> 00:00:39,304
And...

18
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:41,441
He's attractive.

19
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:47,213
I knew I had a bad feeling
about this...

20
00:00:55,055 --> 00:00:56,633
A married man seduced
three employees?

21
00:00:56,634 --> 00:00:57,754
What was the owner thinking?

22
00:00:58,124 --> 00:01:00,060
My worst nightmare
was haunting me again.
